      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so scary how much they seem to know. it's like they're watching me to see exactly where to hit so i'll break. i'm starting to think they've been coordinating this for a while, maybe even using my HR file to plan these specific little \"accidents.\" if they're actually trying to induce a mental breakdown to save money on my severance, what kind of specific \"micro-aggressions\" should i be looking out for next so i'm not caught off guard?",
